        "original_id": "f9925d72-57b4-593b-8bc2-ffc201903d9e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Affenpinscher, Villanuco de Las Encartaciones, German Pinscher, Dobermann, Rottweiler, Miniature Pinscher, Standard Schnauzer, Miniature Schnauzer, Giant Schnauzer\n- Places: Las Encartaciones, Biscay, Cantabria, Burgos, Spain\n- Concepts: dog breeds, breed origins, alternative names, regional distribution\n\nFacts:\n- The Affenpinscher is also known as the Monkey Terrier and is a terrier-like toy breed of dog.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is a Spanish breed of dog typical of Las Encartaciones in Biscay, Cantabria, and northern Burgos in Spain.\n- The Villanuco de Las Encartaciones is called Enkarterriko billanuko in Basque, Villanucu in Cantabrian, and Little Villein of Las Encartaciones in English.\n- The German Pinscher is included in the origins of the Dobermann, the Rottweiler, the Miniature Pinscher, the Affenpinscher, and the Standard Schnauzer.\n- The German Pinscher is also included in the origins of the Miniature Schnauzer and Giant Schnauzer by way of the Standard Schnauzer.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
